<title>UK: TABLE TENNIS-KONG LINGHUI AND LIU GUOLIANG WIN DOUBLES GOLD.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-KONG LINGHUI AND LIU GUOLIANG WIN DOUBLES GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kong Linghui and Liu Guoliang of China won the men's doubles gold medal at the world table tennis championships on Monday while Jan-Ove Waldner and Jorgen Persson of Sweden collected the silver.</p>
</text>
